								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=706.msg6243#msg6243">Re:Car Washes....and Tipping</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> March 15, 2004, 11:09:30 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Which Danny&#039;s ?<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
